        "f4322883-7587-5068-971b-f3ec30affb1a"
      ]
    },
    {
      "step_number": 2,
      "instruction": "Thread vegetables and chicken onto skewers. Cook the skewers on the barbecue or griddle for 5-8 mins, turning every so often, until the chicken is cooked through and charred.",
